# THE TIER MAP (2026-10-23 night) - who can compile the parable

Round-3 construction-transfer differential widened to the full local
battery: 8 lanes x 2 passes (neutral / spec-primed), sequential, local
ollama via the llm.py organ, $0, headless. Prompt-of-record embedded in
every output file under canon/same_book/round3/tiermap/. Graded against
canon/same_book/KEY_V1.md (the withheld key, now a first-class grader
instrument with its own falsifier). The REPLICATION_RECEIPT_20261022.md
two-pass result (qwen2.5-coder:7b + gemma4) is included in the table.

## The ladder (compile depth, worst to best)

refuse < tangent < confabulate < form < themes < mechanisms

